. <b>small</b> → ______","p":["heavier","taller","shorter","smaller"],"a":"smaller","aras":1},{"id":"t3-bi-10.d5a001","j":"mcq","s":"tall → taller. <b>long</b> → ______","p":["hotter","stronger","longer","shorter"],"a":"longer","aras":1},{"id":"t3-bi-10.fe03ef","j":"mcq","s":"An elephant is ______ than a cat.","p":["more big","bigger","biggest","big"],"a":"bigger","aras":1},{"id":"t3-bi-10.545093","j":"mcq","s":"The giraffe is the ______ animal.","p":["tallest","tall","taller","most tall"],"a":"tallest","aras":1},{"id":"t3-bi-10.bc187c","j":"mcq","s":"A mouse is ______ than a dog.","p":["small","more small","smaller","smallest"],"a":"smaller","aras":1},{"id":"t3-bi-10.a6c401","j":"mcq","s":"We ______ keep the park clean.","p":["must","don't","mustn't","can't"],"a":"must","aras":1},{"id":"t3-bi-10.326525","j":"mcq","s":"Which action is <b>good for the Earth</b>?","p":["burn rubbish","throw rubbish in the river","plant trees","waste water"],"a":"plant trees","aras":1},{"id":"t3-bi-10.b0d1cc","j":"mcq","s":"Which action is <b>good for the Earth</b>?","p":["recycle paper","throw rubbish in the river","leave the lights on","burn rubbish"],"a":"recycle paper","aras":1},{"id":"t3-bi-10.4ccfcd","j":"mcq","s":"Which action is <b>good for the Earth</b>?","p":["switch off the lights","cut down many trees","burn rubbish","waste water"],"a":"switch off the lights","aras":1},{"id":"t3-bi-10.c8bcc9","j":"mcq","s":"Which action is <b>bad for the Earth</b>?","p":["switch off the lights","throw rubbish in the river","plant trees","save water"],"a":"throw rubbish in the river","aras":1},{"id":"t3-bi-10.e516c5","j":"isi","s":"tall → taller. <b>big</b> → ______","bank":["bigger","hotter","stronger","longer"],"a":"bigger","aras":2},{"id":"t3-bi-10.432a68","j":"isi","s":"tall → taller. <b>fast</b> → ______","bank":["smaller","hotter","taller","faster"],"a":"faster","aras":2},{"id":"t3-bi-10.0c7c5c","j":"isi","s":"tall → taller. <b>hot</b> → ______","bank":["hotter","longer","taller","happier"],"a":"hotter","aras":2},{"id":"t3-bi-10.200675","j":"isi","s":"A cheetah is ______ than a turtle.","bank":["fast","faster","more fast","fastest"],"a":"faster","aras":2},{"id":"t3-bi-10.31e54f","j":"bs","s":"To <i>save water</i> is bad for the Earth.","a":"Salah","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t3-bi-10.878ff5","j":"bs","s":"To <i>use a cloth bag</i> is good for the Earth.","a":"Betul","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t3-bi-10.88135c","j":"bs","s":"To <i>cut down many trees</i> is bad for the Earth.","a":"Betul","aras":1,"label":["True","False"]},{"id":"t3-bi-10.241754","j":"padankan","s":"Match the word to its comparing form.","pasangan":[["tall","taller"],["big","bigger"],["small","smaller"],["fast","faster"]],"aras":2},{"id":"t3-bi-10.af3e36","j":"jadual","s":"Choose the comparing form.","kepala":["Word","Comparing form"],"bank":["hotter","faster","longer","smaller"],"baris":[{"sel":["small"],"a":"smaller"},{"sel":["fast"],"a":"faster"},{"sel":["long"],"a":"longer"},{"sel":["hot"],"a":"hotter"}],"aras":3}]}]}